Announcing our Expo Partners for AIE CODE! Join us Nov 19 - 21 to meet with the founders, leaders, and engineers at some of the most relevant, forward-thinking, innovative companies in AI:
Presenting Sponsor:
@GoogleDeepMind
We are proud to have Google DeepMind as presenting sponsor. From being the original inventors of Transformers and TPUs to owning the Pareto Frontier of Cost per Intelligence and processing 1.3 quadrillion tokens a month, they have exploded on to the scene with SOTA offerings in every modality!
Platinum Sponsor:
@anthropicai
We are proud to have Anthropic as Platinum sponsor for the first time at AIE. After launching the first MCP workshop at our last Summit, Anthropic followed up with Claude Code which has exploded to over $500m ARR in 6 months, and launched the Claude 4 series of models which are now the top coding models in the world on SWE-Bench Pro.
Gold Sponsors:
@cursor_ai - Built to make you extraordinarily productive, Cursor is the best way to code with AI.
@FactoryAI - Factory ranked #1 on Terminal-Bench, outperforming Claude Code, Cursor, and Devin. Droids run on any LLM, in any IDE, locally or remotely. Delegate from Terminal, IDE, Slack, or the web.
@AmpCode - Amp, by @Sourcegraph, is an agentic coding tool engineered to maximize what’s possible with today’s frontier models - autonomous reasoning, comprehensive code editing, and complex task execution.
@cognition_labs - Cognition is an applied AI lab focused on building the future of software engineering. Cognition is the company behind Devin, the world’s first AI software engineer, and Windsurf, the leading agentic IDE. Cognition empowers developers with coding agents and tools that automate complex software development tasks, accelerating the pace of human innovation.
@neo4j - Neo4j, the Graph Database & Analytics Company, helps organizations find hidden relationships and patterns across billions of data connections deeply, easily, and quickly.
@auth0 - Auth0 is an adaptable authentication and authorization platform that offers an implementation that's as simple as development teams want, and as flexible and customizable as they need. It delivers convenience, privacy, and security so you can focus on building a great user experience.
@GetStigg - Your AI burns compute, and cash. Stigg gives AI teams the building blocks for usage-based monetization, like credits, metering, gating, and pricing orchestration, without slowing down dev velocity.
@getsentry - Sentry helps detect, understand, and fix broken code, fast. Sentry’s debugging platform is used by over 4 million developers to free up dev cycles by decreasing resolution time from days to minutes.
@daytonaio - Daytona is an advanced AI sandbox platform delivering lightning-fast, secure infrastructure for running and testing AI-generated code.
@graphite - Graphite is the complete AI code review platform built to keep you unblocked.
@weights_biases Weights & Biases is the AI developer platform powering the AI industry. AI labs and enterprises rely on Weights & Biases as their system of record for training and fine-tuning AI models and developing agentic AI applications with confidence. Weights & Biases has been acquired by CoreWeave to deliver the leading AI Cloud Platform — purpose-built to develop, deploy, and iterate AI faster for the world’s leading AI labs and enterprises.
@workos - WorkOS is the modern identity and enterprise features platform for B2B apps, powering SSO, SCIM, RBAC, Audit Logs, and more. Trusted by OpenAI, Cursor, Vercel, and 1,000+ others.
Silver Sponsors:
@arizeai - Arize is the single platform built to help you accelerate development of AI apps and agents – then perfect them in production.
@baz_scm - Baz is your AI code review agent—analyzing code, detecting breakage, and enforcing conventions to help developers ship faster and with confidence.
@goose_oss (from @blocks) - Local open source AI agent that automates complex dev tasks, is LLM-agnostic, and integrates with MCP
@elastic - Elastic, the Search AI Company, integrates its expertise in search technology with artificial intelligence to help everyone transform data into answers, actions, and outcomes. Elastic's Search AI Platform — the foundation for its search, observability, and security solutions — is used by more than 50% of the Fortune 500.
@turbopuffer - serverless vector and full-text search built from first principles on object storage: fast, 10x cheaper, and extremely scalable
@redhat - Red Hat AI allows organizations to manage and monitor the lifecycle of both predictive and gen AI models at scale, from single-server deployments to highly scaled-out distributed platforms.
@greptile - Greptile reviews GitHub/GitLab PRs with full codebase context, flags logic/style/perf/security issues, suggests fixes, and adapts to your custom rules.
@modal Deploy generative AI models, large-scale batch jobs, job queues, and more on Modal's platform. We help data science and machine learning teams accelerate development, reduce costs, and effortlessly scale workloads across thousands of CPUs and GPUs. Our pay-per-use model ensures you're billed only for actual compute time, down to the CPU cycle. No more wasted resources or idle costs—just efficient, scalable computing power when you need it.
@DeepgramAI - Deepgram is the leading voice AI platform designed for developers building voice-first products using speech-to-text, text-to-speech, or speech-to-speech APIs. Over 350,000 developers build with Deepgram's voice-native foundational models - accessed through APIs or as self-managed software – due to our unmatched accuracy, latency and pricing.
@Cometml - Log, test, and iterate with Opik at each stage of your dev cycle to confidently scale AI agents and LLM-powered apps from prototype to production.
